      "start_seconds": 0.94,
      "end_seconds": 7.62,
      "duration_seconds": 6.68,
      "text": "Come in, have a seat by the desk. Is this your first time with this clinic?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.22,
      "end_seconds": 14.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.92,
      "text": "Mm, first time with this one, yes. A friend recommended it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.78,
      "end_seconds": 19.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "What would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.58,
      "end_seconds": 25.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Um, so... dizziness on standing. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.51,
      "end_seconds": 32.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.21,
      "end_seconds": 40.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "It's been about four days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.04,
      "end_seconds": 48.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.85,
      "end_seconds": 62.97,
      "duration_seconds": 13.12,
      "text": "Yes, standing. That makes it worse. It's on and off. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.9,
      "end_seconds": 67.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Did you get severe tummy pain, vomiting or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.76,
      "end_seconds": 73.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "No, no severe tummy pain, vomiting or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.61,
      "end_seconds": 77.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.63,
      "end_seconds": 81.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Actually, no, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.6,
      "end_seconds": 87.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.3,
      "end_seconds": 95.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "No, you know, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.87,
      "end_seconds": 98.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.22,
      "end_seconds": 100.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.67,
      "end_seconds": 116.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.54,
      "end_seconds": 121.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.37,
      "end_seconds": 126.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.65,
      "end_seconds": 132.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.95,
      "end_seconds": 139.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Okay, does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.45,
      "end_seconds": 144.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "My mother has an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.76,
      "end_seconds": 149.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.63,
      "end_seconds": 156.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.82,
      "end_seconds": 173.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.59,
      "end_seconds": 189.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.42,
      "end_seconds": 209.96,
      "duration_seconds": 9.54,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 99 percent on room air, pulse is 108 beats a minute. And BP is 101 over 58, respiratory rate 19."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.61,
      "end_seconds": 216.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.83,
      "end_seconds": 219.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.93,
      "end_seconds": 236.72,
      "duration_seconds": 9.79,
      "text": "The creases in your palms and your scars are darker than they should be and your blood pressure drops when you stand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.41,
      "end_seconds": 244.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.44,
      "end_seconds": 277.43,
      "duration_seconds": 14.99,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. My working impression is possible adrenal insufficiency. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Let's get a morning cortisol, for possible adrenal insufficiency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.32,
      "end_seconds": 281.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Let me think, is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.17,
      "end_seconds": 299.81,
      "duration_seconds": 16.64,
      "text": "Drink fluids and eat salty foods until the results, and come in if you vomit. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse. Book a review after the results. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.15,
      "end_seconds": 302.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.1,
      "end_seconds": 307.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
